values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-394e75352814-exercise-05', 'en', 'B2', 'Transformação de frase', 'Transforme a frase para a terceira condicional.', 'I didn''t study, so I failed the test. → If I had studied, I would have passed the test.', 'He didn''t listen to the advice, so he made a mistake. Como transformar?', '["If he had listened to the advice, he wouldn''t have made a mistake.","If he listened to the advice, he wouldn''t make a mistake.","If he would have listened, he wouldn''t have made a mistake.","If he has listened, he wouldn''t have made a mistake."]'::jsonb, 0, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-394e75352814')
