values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-4caddeed56b7-exercise-05', 'en', 'B2', 'Mixed Reported Speech: Pulling It All Together', 'Combine as regras de recuo, mudanças de pronomes e expressões de tempo em frases complexas.', 'Direct: "I will call you tomorrow," she said. → Reported: She said she would call me the next day.', 'Choose the correct reported version: "We are having a party tonight," they told us.', '["They told us they are having a party tonight.","They told us they were having a party that night.","They told us they had a party that night.","They told us they were having a party tonight."]'::jsonb, 1, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-4caddeed56b7')
