values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-986f63b205b5-exercise-02', 'en', 'B2', 'Exercise 2: Identify the correct mixed conditional sentence.', 'Escolha a frase que usa corretamente a condicional mista (passado + presente).', 'If I had taken that job, I would be rich now.', 'Which sentence uses the mixed conditional correctly?', '["If I had taken that job, I would have been rich now.","If I took that job, I would be rich now.","If I had taken that job, I would be rich now.","If I would have taken that job, I would be rich now."]'::jsonb, 2, 2, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-986f63b205b5')
