values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-986f63b205b5-exercise-05', 'en', 'B2', 'Exercise 5: Rewrite the sentence using the third conditional.', 'Reescreva a frase dada usando a terceira condicional.', 'He didn''t study, so he failed. -> If he had studied, he would have passed.', 'She was late, so she missed the beginning of the film. Which sentence correctly uses the third conditional?', '["If she wasn''t late, she wouldn''t miss the beginning.","If she hadn''t been late, she wouldn''t have missed the beginning.","If she isn''t late, she won''t miss the beginning.","If she wouldn''t be late, she wouldn''t have missed the beginning."]'::jsonb, 1, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-986f63b205b5')
