values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-48f77e825138-exercise-05', 'en', 'B2', 'Exercise 5: Correct the mistake', 'Encontre a opção que corrige o erro na frase apresentada.', 'She has went to the store. → She has gone to the store.', 'We have been living in this city for 10 years. (Esta frase está correta?) Se não, qual é a correção?', '["Está correta.","We have been live in this city for 10 years.","We have been lived in this city for 10 years.","We have living in this city for 10 years."]'::jsonb, 0, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-48f77e825138')
