values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-369a8d43fc5b-exercise-03', 'en', 'B2', 'Reported Commands and Requests', 'Use ''told'' ou ''asked'' + objeto + ''to'' + verbo. ''Told'' para ordens, ''asked'' para pedidos.', 'Direct: ''Please sit down.'' -> Reported: ''He asked us to sit down.''', 'Choose the correct reported command: ''Don''t touch that!''', '["She told me not to touch that.","She told me to not touch that.","She told that I don''t touch that.","She said me not to touch that."]'::jsonb, 0, 3, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-369a8d43fc5b')
