values ('generated-grammar-en-b2-a75ba54e592e-exercise-03', 'en', 'B2', 'Exercise 3: Rewrite the Sentence', 'Reescreva a frase dada usando a forma indicada.', 'Original: I didn''t know about the meeting, so I didn''t attend. Rewrite with ''If I had known''.', 'Rewrite: She didn''t save money, so she can''t buy a house now. Use ''If she had saved''.', '["If she had saved money, she would be able to buy a house now.","If she saved money, she would have bought a house now.","If she had saved money, she would have bought a house now.","If she would have saved money, she could buy a house now."]'::jsonb, 0, 3, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b2-a75ba54e592e')
